        "08c14c21-864a-420f-9bc3-16b284d655be": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "THE BRACELET",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "15aa95b8-a3b2-4185-ae61-28deeb4c5c79": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Upon acquiring our ethically-sourced gemstones and beads from trusted suppliers, we bring these treasures to our headquarters in Copenhagen, Denmark, where artistry meets craftsmanship. Here, every piece of jewelry is hand-braided with precision and care, ensuring a fusion of beauty and durability. Our dedication to maintaining high quality is unwavering, as each creation embodies the design passion and meticulous attention to detail that Denmark is renowned for, resulting in pieces that are not only stunning but also crafted to stand the test of time.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
